\contentsline {section}{\numberline {7}评价与讨论}{14}{section.7}%
\contentsline {subsection}{\numberline {7.1}论文的非凡之处}{14}{subsection.7.1}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{1. 问对了问题，并且答得干净利落。}{14}{paragraph*.30}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{2. 方法论上的真正创新：给数据流下界装上了“信息论 + 几何”的引擎。}{14}{paragraph*.31}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{3. 一个副产品比主定理还要长寿：Gap-Hamming 问题。}{15}{paragraph*.32}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{4. 工具皆为成熟成品，组合方式却出人意料。}{15}{paragraph*.33}%
\contentsline {subsection}{\numberline {7.2}局限与批评}{15}{subsection.7.2}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{1. 参数范围不够紧致，留下了 $m^{-1/9}$ 与 $m^{-1/2}$ 之间的 gap。}{15}{paragraph*.34}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{2. 模型覆盖面窄。}{15}{paragraph*.35}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{3. 行文密度过高，存在若干伤读者的小瑕疵。}{15}{paragraph*.36}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{4. 结构性直觉着墨不足。}{15}{paragraph*.37}%
